{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：09:48 2026-06-30 HKT</p>\n\n<p>龍翔道發生涉及警車的交通意外。今日（30日）早上8時06分，一輛黑色私家車沿龍翔道快線往觀塘方向行駛，當駛至近碧華閣對開一個右彎時，突然失控打「白鴿轉」，並撞向慢線旁邊行人路的石壆，繼而反彈撞及停泊在慢線的一輛警車。警車上一名警員報稱腰痛受傷，意外原因有待調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"私家車撞及警車車尾。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7c7fce49e8003821c77849f1388c8898/2026-06/3_2_17.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警車左邊車尾損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c0c075afab95aef48b643f2b091c328f/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"私家車撞及警車車尾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/96f860ccf348795f1a87a1352e370837/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_06_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"私家車打「白鴿轉」掉頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2e88d909ac1a14b4ba1183c2b407429b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_05_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4c6c78f662d7fd1f3c1bb39f12ab5d26/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9e63deb1df8b6678de9cdba7f2c16ee9/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_05_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"事後拖車到場，拖走涉事私家車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d2245445f215404ddc615726acb7c7fb/2026-06/1_1_39.jpeg\"/>\n<p>事發時涉事警車正停泊在現場慢線，處理另一宗較早前發生的交通事故，清除事故中遺下的一個藍色膠水桶。詎料黑色私家車駛至時再釀成交通意外，撞及警車的車尾。現場所見，警車左邊車尾損毀，黑色私家車則打「白鴿轉」掉頭，車頭損毀嚴重，泵把鬆脫；車尾同告受損。</p>\n<img alt=\"警方在場調查意外原因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f291baab2876c5637c6947160043d29b/2026-06/2_0_39.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/33aa4e6f824f3f508d60ec344e3759f0/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_04_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"行人路石壆被撞毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c29a585636bf1373590c95a669f05748/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_04_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/cdba31f32663350c99ed1c469ad543ba/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_04_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"較早前事故遺下藍色膠桶，警車停泊在場處理期間，被私家車失事撞尾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4436a5ec9fe63d42e51853636ff485da/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_03_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/efc5c6e991c71c830da235a446740cbf/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_03.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1c0c7bde688031000061404d22432fc3/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-30_at_09_08_02.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-30T01:59:14.743882+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":280,"images":14,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}